  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fill cocktail shaker with ice. Pour in horchata, tequila, rum cream liqueur, agave, and cinnamon whiskey. Shake until fully chilled. Dip rim of margarita glass in condensed milk; sprinkle with cinnamon. Pour horchata mixture into the glass.",
